    {
      "id": 980000000106,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "width": 34,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / FIRST-PARTY PERFORMANCE\nMAJOR GLOW -- QUANTIZED ECHO PERFORMANCE\n\nPlay Host MIDI. MIDI pitch -> ScaleQuantizer PITCH\n-> MorphVCO PITCH. Quantizer CHANGE (+10V 2ms)\n-> ADSR RETRIG; MIDI gate -> ADSR GATE.\nC Major (root C, scale Major), transpose 0,\n12-cent hysteresis. All MIDI semitones already lie\nin the chromatic grid; to hear different scale\nchoices, use melodic notes outside the chosen\nscale, slide/bend pitch, or patch external CV.\n\nMorphVCO -> low-gain VCA (ADSR CV) -> StateFilter.\nFilter LP -> StereoEcho L; filter HP -> Echo R.\nEcho L/R -> separate HostAudio2 L/R input jacks.\n\nMACRO8 CV (unipolar 0..+10V):\n0 TIME -> StereoEcho input 2 (+100ms/V)\n1 FEEDBACK -> Echo input 3 (+10 points/V)\n2 WET -> Echo input 4 (+10 points/V)\n3 WAVE -> MorphVCO shape input 2.\n\nEcho base: 120ms, 10% feedback, 12% wet;\n68% stereo crossfeed. Four saved scenes:\nA SLAP: 190ms / 18% feedback / 28% wet\nB CHAMBER: 340ms / 28% / 40%\nC CASCADE: 550ms / 41% / 48%\nD RIPPLES: 800ms / 54% / 57%.\n\nRecall A/B/C/D to glide over 1.2 seconds;\nLIVE returns to current macro knobs. Scenes\nare manual, NOT an LFO or BPM sync.\n\nMonitor volume low. Host MIDI is required.\nNo rendered audio or host-load tests claimed.\n"
      },
      "pos": [
        123,
        0
      ]
    }
